><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Hu</surname><given-names>WG</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>BY</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhu</surname><given-names>ZG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Clinical significance of human kallikrein 10 gene expression in colorectal cancer and gastric cancer</article-title><source>J Gastroenterol Hepatol</source><year>2006</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>1596</fpage><lpage>1603</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Gastroenterol Hepatol||21|1596||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16928223</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heagerty</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lumley</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Pepe</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Time-dependent ROC curves for censored survival data and a diagnostic marker</article-title><source>Biometrics</source><year>2000</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>337</fpage><lpage>344</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biometrics||56|337||bib15|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10877287</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Henkhaus</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Gerner</surname><given-names>EW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ignatenko</surname><given-names>NA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Kallikrein 6 is a mediator of K-RAS-dependent migration of colon carcinoma cells</article-title><source>Biol Chem</source><year>2008a</year><volume>389</volume><fpage>757</fpage><lpage>764</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biol Chem||389|757||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18627290</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="